about early learning today

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:54.770
from early learning all
the way through elementary,

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:56.770
middle and high school and ways,

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:00.340
learning plans and schedules
that can help folks.

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:03.200
And then also to do this so
that we can stay connected

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.640
