00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:34.653
it's your point it was 20 minutes per day.

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:39.080
And that essentially closed
the gap between the students

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:42.160
who are performing a good bit,
below where they need to be.

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:44.630
And getting essentially
to the national average,

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:46.070
