00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:21.780
- So Khan Academy Kids,
each of our lessons

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:23.760
is aligned with national standards.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:25.920
So for preschool, it's the headstart

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:29.260
early learning outcomes
framework for literacy and math.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.920
And then for kindergarten and first grade,

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.370
it's the Common Core Standards.

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:37.320
And we've worked with educators
from the Stanford Ed school,

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:40.000
who are who specialized in early learning

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.410
and child development.

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:45.800
To make sure that our lessons
