00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:55.730
And what we've learned through
looking at the research

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:58.130
on the learning of science learning,

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:00.817
is that technology has the power

00:08:00.817 --> 00:08:04.000
