00:15:57.910 --> 00:16:00.410
I think at the top of our minds,

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:03.032
we designed Khan Academy Kids

00:16:03.032 --> 00:16:06.210
to make sure that it was
developmentally appropriate.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:09.610
And not to focus on using technology

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:10.820
for hours and hours on end.

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:13.200
It's designed for kids to be using

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:15.818
in five to 10 to 20 minute increments

00:16:15.818 --> 00:16:18.980
depending on their age and
what's appropriate for them.

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:23.460
So some ways that we've
done that is, there is Cody

00:16:24.684 --> 00:16:26.333
in designed activities,

00:16:26.333 --> 00:16:29.074
so that after a lesson
you are coming back out

00:16:29.074 --> 00:16:32.924
and the lessons are paced
to be short increments

00:16:32.924 --> 00:16:34.900
with an introductory video

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:38.310
and then highly active
interactive experiences.

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:40.030
And then after a few activities

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:43.410
will tell your kids to
get up and sing this song

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:46.585
or dance and so, or go outside
and take a look at the leaves

00:16:46.585 --> 00:16:49.470
or something like that
related to the story.

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:54.010
So we really are cognizant
of not having it,

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:56.290
be an experience that
just sucks your kids in.

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:59.070
Which a lot of adult
technology as we all know

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:01.890
from social media, and all that
is designed to be addictive.

00:17:01.890 --> 00:17:04.349
So we're on the congress designed to be,

00:17:04.349 --> 00:17:08.830
hands on, minds on learning,
but not sucking your kids in.

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:12.500
You can kind of tell when
they get that glazed over look

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:15.359
for things that are not active learning.

00:17:15.359 --> 00:17:18.880
And so we designed it to
be active and interactive.

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:23.710
Another thing is, I think
just being we have come out

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:26.760
with some schedules for kids
just as a starting point.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:30.520
