to the day does help,

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:38.370
particularly with young
children and them knowing okay,

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:42.440
we're gonna have reading time
now, and then in half an hour,

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:43.960
