00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:47.130
And so understanding that regular routine

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:49.160
and that those transitions
that are coming up

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:50.560
can really help.

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:55.560
We really advocate balancing
not only the Khan Academy Kids

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:58.560
all time, but all the other learning

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:00.540
